Measurement files are spectral measurements from the PR-650, and are tabulated as 380nm to 780nm in 4nm steps, therefore with 100 power measurements from those wavelengths. 

They are stored as .csv files, which are named as r{#}_g{#}_b{#}_o{#}_{date}_{time}.csv. These represent what we put in
as 8-bit values, and it is measured spectrally.

We can use the function load_primaries_from_csv(filename) from TetriumColor.Measurement.TetriumMeasurementRoutines in order to load them into a List[Spectra]. 